<title>USA: Southwest Airlines offers 4-day fare sale.</title>
<headline>Southwest Airlines offers 4-day fare sale.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Airlines Corp said Wednesday it is offering domestic fares for 60 percent lower than normal, with none higher than $99 one-way.</p>
<p>The airline said the offer is valid until Sunday and that tickets must be bought within one day of making reservations.</p>
<p>Travelers can use the fares between August 18 and December 16, except on August 29, September 1 and November 25. The airline said the tickets require no stayover and are non-refundable.</p>
</text>
